# `bin/` and `obj/` on their own match only the context root, and every one of
# these actually lives a level down, in Recruitment.Gorilla.API/ and
# Recruitment.Gorilla.Tests/. So the host's build output was being copied into
# the image, and the restore inside the container then read a project.assets.json
# written on Windows — which failed on "Unable to find fallback package folder
# 'C:\Program Files (x86)\Microsoft Visual Studio\Shared\NuGetPackages'".
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Logs/
**/Uploads/*
!**/Uploads/.gitkeep
**/*.user
**/.vs/
